Output demo/init.gif

Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1000
Set Height 600
Set Padding 20
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Env XDG_CONFIG_HOME "/tmp/mueta_demo_config"

Type "mueta init"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "/home/user/Music"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "/home/user/Lyrics"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "your_acoustid_api_key..."
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "optional_genius_token..."
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 10s
